@startuml
actor User
participant "ksys" as Ksys
participant "optix CLI" as CLI
participant "PipelineOrchestrator" as Orchestrator
participant "Ingest/Normalize/Diagnose/Index/Rule/Suggest" as Stages
participant "PluginManager" as PM
participant "AdvisorPlugin" as Advisor
participant "Apply Command" as Apply
participant "Source Code" as SRC
participant "EventBus" as Bus

User -> Ksys : stability-check/collect
Ksys --> User : 生成 ksys 原始日志/结果

User -> CLI : optix run --ksys ... --src ...
CLI -> PM : 加载 parser/rulepack/reporter/transformer/advisor 插件
CLI -> Orchestrator : execute(ctx)

Orchestrator -> Bus : stage_start(ingest)
Orchestrator -> Stages : ingest.run()
Stages --> Orchestrator : RawMetricRecords
Orchestrator -> Bus : stage_end(ingest)

Orchestrator -> Stages : normalize.run()
Stages --> Orchestrator : Signals
Orchestrator -> Stages : diagnose.run()
Stages --> Orchestrator : BottleneckSemantic
Orchestrator -> Stages : index.run()
Stages --> Orchestrator : CodeFactGraph
Orchestrator -> Stages : rule.run()
Stages --> Orchestrator : CodeOpportunity
Orchestrator -> Stages : suggest.run()
Stages -> Advisor : enrich(suggestions)
Advisor --> Stages : 建议增强
Stages --> Orchestrator : Suggestions + report + patch
Orchestrator -> Bus : stage_end(suggest)

CLI --> User : report.md/report.json/patch.diff/artifacts

User -> Apply : optix apply --suggest ... --src-root ...
Apply -> SRC : 备份文件
Apply -> SRC : 注入 OPTIX_APPLIED 建议
Apply --> User : apply_summary + 变更结果
@enduml
